7,Common Voice Scripted Speech 26.0 - Indus Kohistani,https://mozilladatacollective.com/datasets/cmqiof7ux00z0nq07it6kz3sm,"Indus Kohistani is an Indo-Aryan language spoken in District Lower Kohistan, Upper Kohistan, Gilgit Baltistan and other parts of Pakistan. There are few books written and published in this language.","Kohistani, Indus",Indo-European
